@hote = http://localhost:5129

### Catalogue public, sans authentification
GET {{hote}}/api/logements

### Catalogue public avec filtres
GET {{hote}}/api/logements?ville=Saint-Jean-sur-Richelieu&loyerMax=1000&nbPiecesMin=3&type=Appartement

### Fiche d'un logement
GET {{hote}}/api/logements/1

### Connexion du prepose
# @name connexion
POST {{hote}}/api/auth/connexion
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courriel": "prepose@locavisite.ca",
  "motDePasse": "Test1234!"
}

### Creation d'un logement, reservee aux roles PREPOSE et GESTIONNAIRE
POST {{hote}}/api/logements
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{connexion.response.body.jeton}}

{
  "adresse": "12 rue Champlain",
  "ville": "Saint-Jean-sur-Richelieu",
  "codePostal": "J3B 1A1",
  "type": "Maison",
  "nbPieces": 6,
  "loyerMensuel": 1600,
  "description": "Maison avec cour."
}

### Modification d'un logement
PUT {{hote}}/api/logements/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{connexion.response.body.jeton}}

{
  "adresse": "125 rue Richelieu",
  "ville": "Saint-Jean-sur-Richelieu",
  "codePostal": "J3B 6X3",
  "type": "Appartement",
  "nbPieces": 4,
  "loyerMensuel": 975,
  "description": "Quatre et demi renove."
}

### Retrait logique : le statut passe a RETIRE
DELETE {{hote}}/api/logements/1
Authorization: Bearer {{connexion.response.body.jeton}}
